### Reading Data from Students Table
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet

### Creating record in Students Table
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "name": "John Doe",
      "adress": "327 Main St, Philadelphia",
      "email": "Jonh.doe@example.com",
      "mobile": "+1-666-901-4433",
      "age": 35,
      "gender": "Male"
}


### Update Data
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet(studentID='32bb1d29-c454-41d3-a551-ff7251780447')
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "email": "david.smith@outlook.com"
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet('32bb1d29-c454-41d3-a551-ff7251780447')


### Composition examples
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/Authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "name": "John Doe",
      "books": [
            {
                  "name": "SAP Learning BTP",
                  "title":  "BTP Book",
                  "publishedDate": "10-10-2020"
            },
            {
                  "name": "BTP CAPM",
                  "title":  "BTP CAPM",
                  "publishedDate": "10-10-2021"
            }
      ]
}